# Login API build uploads the repo root (the config's step uses dir: poultrycore_Backend),
# but the Dockerfile only COPYs LoginAPI/. Exclude the heavy / actively-written trees so
# the source archive is small and gcloud never locks on the live dev server's .next/ files.
.git/
**/node_modules/
**/.next/
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/dist/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
*.log
